        "end": 21,
        "start": 21
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The most natural reading of the statute estab- lishes that each failure to report a qualifying foreign account constitutes a separate reporting violation, so the Govern- ment can levy penalties on a per-account basis."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Barrett",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1195",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "12b9360b9eb1a9590bd0183e90c7357bd2f60b55e2b49201f752994ab121aa91",
      "evidence_id": "ev-12b9360b9eb1-0002-0001",
      "kind": "dissent",
      "opinion_part": "dissent",
      "pages": {
        "end": 22,
        "start": 22
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The text of \u00a7 5314 indicates that its reporting requirement attaches to each individual account."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Barrett",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1195",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "12b9360b9eb1a9590bd0183e90c7357bd2f60b55e2b49201f752994ab121aa91",
      "evidence_id": "ev-12b9360b9eb1-0002-0002",
      "kind": "dissent",
      "opinion_part": "dissent",
      "pages": {
        "end": 26,
        "start": 26
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "A person who fails to report multiple foreign accounts on a single annual form violates the BSA and its implementing regulations multiple times, not just once."
    },
